on what lifestyle we’re funding.” \n\nThe group suggests the proposer to sharpen their comedic chops before next budget.","createdAt":"2025-04-25T01:28:00.324Z","updatedAt":"2025-04-30T08:13:36.458Z","bd_proposal_id":"682","drep_id":null,"user_govtool_username":"awen","user_is_validated":false,"subcommens_number":0}},{"id":1650,"attributes":{"proposal_id":null,"comment_parent_id":null,"comment_text":"Given there are a lot of competing proposals for this year's limited budget, I am voting \"no\" and recommend trying your cash grab again at a later date (or saving reviewer time and considering this \"no\" permanent)","createdAt":"2025-04-25T04:16:13.548Z","updatedAt":"2025-04-30T08:13:36.482Z","bd_proposal_id":"682","drep_id":"b102197ee2affaebd50fcb8ca69fb4fa9eba931f4cc219f18db6d7e6","user_govtool_username":"sebastiengllmt","user_is_validated":false,"subcommens_number":0}},{"id":1652,"attributes":{"proposal_id":null,"comment_parent_id":null,"comment_text":"Funny joke, but a waste of time and resources for DReps. I see the point of this as a critque to the level of quality and spam than can be put through this current budget process.","createdAt":"2025-04-25T04:48:57.475Z","updatedAt":"2025-04-30T08:13:36.494Z","bd_proposal_id":"682","drep_id":"cc37fee8a4bca7120ce97b852213aff16aa09999c8e35809c5e00444","user_govtool_username":"gaia","user_is_validated":false,"subcommens_number":0}},{"id":1763,"attributes":{"proposal_id":null,"comment_parent_id":null,"comment_text":"While I see the supposed humor, the accumulated time spent dealing with this spam across all dreps that took the time to read the proposals, just adds to their frustration levels and decreases the likelyhood of investing more in reading proposals. It is a rock thrown at the community windows \"as a joke\". It isn't funny.","createdAt":"2025-04-25T13:25:06.268Z","updatedAt":"2025-04-30T08:13:36.442Z","bd_proposal_id":"682","drep_id":"bf7cf9d35407a66f2744f1dac876bb2bee5e2bb7e04b6c606384d055","user_govtool_usern